WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
Sir, what do you mean by that?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.190
Just what it looks like.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.690
You're the true culprit.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.910
You controlled Father Karabo
to murder Trisha Fellows.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.780
That can't be, sir!

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.540
I don't think you have
neither a motive nor evidence.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.710
Yeah. That's why I was waiting for him.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.420
I was having a really hard time, sir.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.710
If Svin hadn't been able
to find me,

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.460
I don't know what would've happened.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.380
Mr. Caules?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.590
You've really done it this time, Waver!

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.010
What in the world is going on here?

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.050
This is what it means.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.470
Ms. Reines!

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.850
It was really strenuous
to fly here using Touko Travel.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.730
Well, Flat's end went
through the worst of it, for sure.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.400
That sure was an exciting
extracurricular lesson!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.870
Oh boy! To predetermine
a destination,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:02.290
then force a flight spell as if pulling
a super-lengthy piece of rubber...

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:08.290
I didn't think you could implement
flight by Magecraft in that fashion.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.500
Looked like they were going
at least Mach 1.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.090
I wonder if they're still alive.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:17.090
They can definitely arrive at the Rail Zeppelin
without an invitation that way.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.140
It's so logical that the means and the end
were completely reversed!

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:23.140
It's an ingenious trick!

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.390
I will never do anything like that!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.310
When did you realize it?

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.780
I thought I had perfectly traced
the real Caules.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.150
You only made one mistake.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.200
That was treating me.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.070
It would be impossible for Caules
to perform such a splendid treatment.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:46.290
I see. I overdid it because
I'd be troubled if you passed away.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:50.290
So, you had already swapped
by the time we boarded the train.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.800
My preparations were perfect.

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.800
You didn't feel any doubt, did you?

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.130
And the source of all that
information was you,

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.300
wasn't it?

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:04.930
He promised me that I could analyze
the Mystic Eyes once we won the auction!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.060
So, that's why I asked Ms. Adashino
to put up an act for us.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.360
I see.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.320
So, everything was buying time just for this.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.820
Who are you?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:19.240
Don't you have an idea who already?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.160
Yes. It's a pleasure to meet you,

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.580
the previous Department Head
of Modern Magecraft Theories...

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.000
Doctor Heartless!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.600
Doctor Heartless. The man
whose heart was stolen by Fairies.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.690
Only you can easily open the safe
of Modern Magecraft Theories

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.190
and also provide funding to Yvette.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.770
That's right.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.860
I've been wanting to meet you.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.700
- That can't possibly be all.
- Oh?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.700
That transformation spell is similar
to the spell style of Gueldoa Davenant.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.950
The sponsor for Sir Davenant provided
funding for the Marberry Workshop,

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.120
and was trying to do something

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.630
using the power of Leylines.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.050
You've been leaving a trail all along

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.420
as if you were an examiner
watching over poor-performing students.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:47.430
I see. But don't you have
more deductions, as well?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.930
That's right.
What happened to the whydunit?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:56.100
This case is nothing but a residual image.
It has long since attained its objective.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.070
So, it wasn't meant to obtain
Ms. Trisha's Mystic Eyes?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.440
The main objective lies elsewhere.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.780
The Holy Grail War.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.740
Heartless seeks the Holy Grail War?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:10.200
I have to hand it to Luvia.
She did good research.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.290
To think that you,

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:16.250
who supposedly went missing, were jointly
investigating with Lord Animusphere...

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:20.040
So, this man was who my father
requested the investigation?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.760
You secretly joined forces
with Astromancy seven years ago,

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.010
and controlled Karabo
to execute a serial murder.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.550
And taking their Mystic Eyes,
head and all while still alive,

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:35.020
you used their powers to obtain, monopolize
and hide information about the Holy Grail War.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.020
Good. Very good.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.570
But those are only circumstantial
evidence and speculation.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.530
You have nothing concrete.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.030
The Greater Grail
can't become a wish granter.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.660
That fact despaired Lord Animusphere.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.620
However, that doesn't mean
that The Greater Grail is worthless.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.370
What do you mean?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.250
Heroic Spirits, my lady. The fact
that you can summon Heroic Spirits...

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.420
There's no falsehood within that function.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.960
Heartless, you created a Holy Grail.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.670
Excellent!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.890
The Mystic Eyes Collection Train
and the Child of Einnashe.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:15.640
By placing both of them on the same Leyline,
you are sure to create a distortion.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.270
The birth of another Holy Grail.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.940
I see. So, you could call it
a variant of the Holy Grail.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.940
Of course, this alone can't materialize
as that of the Holy Grail War.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:31.160
You need some trick,
such as connecting this Leyline to Japan.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:35.700
But he needed something more than
anything else to pretend it was a Greater Grail.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.870
He needed Waver Velvet,

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.750
a man who was once a Master.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:45.750
A previous Master and a Holy Grail variant
linked to The Greater Grail...

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.420
That's the stage contraption you needed.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.470
In other words, your crime of summoning
a Servant has long since been committed. Right?

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.350
The Holy Grail War was truly intriguing.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.810
Because it was an impossible
fairy tale even for Mages,

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.150
I was enchanted by it
more than anything else.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.980
Trisha's murder was nothing
more than an addendum.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:09.570
Deleting the Mystic Eyes of Premonition that has
the possibility of reaching your true guise,

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.200
and obtaining it if possible...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.120
Along with Sir Karabo's Mystic Eyes.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:18.410
However, she predicted the murder
and hid her own head.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.580
Her determination has guided me
all the way here.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.210
How touching!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.380
I understand the situation.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:33.590
Were you the one who summoned
the Child of Einnashe and attacked this train?

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.550
I guess that's how things went.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.390
If it is determined
that you attacked this train,

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.980
you will lose your right
to partake in the auction.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:45.270
Oh, brother. So, things
did end up this way. But...

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.820
this is not enough.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.240
Adashino!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.070
I order you with my Command Spell!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:53.950
Come hither!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:07.590
Adashino!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.550
You finally called for me, Master.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:20.180
The Lord had such an interesting tale.
I couldn't help but overstay.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.310
What is that?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.730
That is a Heroic Spirit!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.520
I'd been thinking
about what exactly you were.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.900
I've introduced myself as Hephaestion.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.740
It's a matter of what class,

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:36.280
such as why you didn't disclose
your class despite disclosing your True Name.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:41.160
The Holy Grail is a fake, the Master
is a fake, the Command Spells are fake!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.670
Normally, such a nonsensical spell
wouldn't succeed.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.670
In other words, she is...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:50.630
Yes. Her class is something
along the lines of a fake Heroic Spirit.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:55.550
Exactly. I've named this new class "Faker."

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.390
Then, who are you saying I am?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.020
The shadow double for Iskandar.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.600
Isn't that so?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.230
Hold on, Elder Brother!
That of all things is too unreasonable!

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.230
Oh? By that, you mean...

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.730
From the tales Elder Brother has told me,

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:15.740
the King of Conquerors was
a redheaded giant over two meters tall!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.990
That's right. However,

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:22.580
said king originally in legend supposedly
had a small frame with black hair,

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:26.670
and heterochromia with one eye
embracing shadows of the night

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.080
and the other embracing the blue skies.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.960
Faker is a residual image of the king,

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.840
a magical double who protected the king

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:39.260
by fabricating gender, appearance
and his entire existence!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.430
You are correct, Magus.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.560
And I have no intent of listening
to any more of your nonsense.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.560
I wouldn't mind fighting right here.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:51.070
But many Mystic Eyes
will be sacrificed by doing so.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.440
Could you possibly open up
the Pandemonium for us?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.280
Understood.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.250
Yvette, what do you plan on doing?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.670
I'll honestly accept my sentence.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.250
I don't want to spend my life as a fugitive.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.460
Oh, I have been rejected. Well then...

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.010
You're not getting away!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.010
Lord El-Melloi II's Case Files
｛Rail Zeppelin｝ Grace note

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:29.230
Oh brother... I do feel it would be
wise for us to part ways here.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.520
You haven't returned the Relic to me!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.900
Oh, I see!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.490
Here.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:48.910
Well then...

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.290
Hold on!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.880
Faker, there's something
I want to ask you, too.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.550
I said I had no intent
of listening to your nonsense!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.260
I'm guessing you have no name at all

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.390
in order to act as a magical double.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.310
Yes, that's right.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.100
I have no name.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:14.610
I was born as the twin sister
for Hephaestion, and sacrificed to the gods.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:19.900
If you have no name, you can absorb
all curses targeting Iskandar.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.620
A powerful adaptation
of the concept of correspondence.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.410
That king had tried many a time
to give me a name,

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.120
and I vehemently declined each time.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:32.670
That's all.
That's all there is to it, Magus.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.040
Then, one problem still remains.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.550
The reason why you didn't appear
as part of Ionioi Hetairoi!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:38.960
Shut up!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:39.800
Add!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.260
Sorry about that, Gray!

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.770
Sir, please strike her with everything
you want to say to her!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.640
Damn you!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.940
Faker, I believe I ordered a retreat.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.480
That comes after I lop his head off!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.230
A spell?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.690
Add, devour it!

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.570
This is great magical power!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.240
What a nuisance!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.080
You said how the king had tried
to give you a name?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:13.460
If so, he didn't accept
your circumstances!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:17.800
There was no way he'd allow you
to be treated as a thing with no name!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.670
And the reason why you weren't
part of Iskandar's army...

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.550
was because you yourself
harbor hatred toward his army!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.220
You bastard!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.230
You won't move that tongue
of yours anymore!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.270
Crafted Tree! I made it in time!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.320
A child's play of a spell!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.610
Caules!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.700
Ms. Gray, take care of the rest!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.530
Okay!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.920
Doctor Heartless!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.420
Unraveling Faker's mystery
was amusing.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.260
How kind of you.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:05.010
Dismantling, Lord El-Melloi II...

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.510
You can't help but to dismantle anything
and everything relating to the Mystics.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.640
I will do so to your experiments,
too, right now.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:15.190
I see. Then, I guess I should try to resist.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.900
<i>Overturn thyself...</i>

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.810
<i>my heart.</i>

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.740
That's...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:27.620
Yes.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.740
I've unleashed the Child of Einnashe!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.850
Does it intend on devouring
this entire train?

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.600
The curtain will now fall
on your clown act!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.480
Sir!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.530
He mentioned it was pretty rough
when he realized that the Earth was round,

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:07.110
and there was no Sea
at the End of the World.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.450
I guess king and subject are rather alike.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:14.910
The empire seeking Okeanos crumbled,
and everything we dreamed of was lost.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.210
Where else do you see
such a horrible outcome?

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.050
What's so funny?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.420
No. I just thought
it was very much like him.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.890
In one way or another, he always misses
something at the end.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.220
Maybe he actually is not talented at all.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.430
Sir...

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.350
Thank you.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.930
What did you say?

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:41.150
There wasn't a day in the past ten years
where I felt vexed by all this.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:45.730
Even if I were to follow in his footsteps,
I didn't know what I needed to be doing!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:49.490
But if I were to tell him I was able
to retaliate against his other self,

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:53.830
I'm sure he'd roll around,
getting a good laugh.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.790
You believe you can win against me?

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.210
Gray, will you assist me?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.580
Yes! I'm going in!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:04.750
Forgive me, Master!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.010
I was planning on being loyal
to my allegiance, but...

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.920
Not much I can do about this.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.220
A magnificent provocation,

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.140
to be expected of someone
who experienced the Holy Grail War.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.680
It's rare for a Servant
and a Master's volitions to coincide.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.100
I'm sorry, but I'll have her riveted down!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.560
You think you can stop me?

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:26.360
No, that is my job!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.740
Karabo Frampton?

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.410
But you are blind.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.530
They were given back to me

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.870
as the auction has been annulled!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.040
Mr. Karabo?

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.880
You dotard!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.520
This is...

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.900
As long as the fact that there was
a slash rises up from the past,

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:07.980
once you enter its range, nothing astral
or physical can defend against it!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:22.710
You will suffer
for controlling me, Heartless!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.170
Oh?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:35.010
However, what will you do
with this many branches?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:36.890
There's nothing we can do...

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.010
if we were by ourselves.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.100
<i>The shape of stars.</i>

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.770
<i>The shape of space.</i>

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.020
<i>The shape of God.</i>

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.440
<i>Right. That's right!</i>

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.440
<i>The shape of self.</i>

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.320
<i>I finally understand!</i>

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.030
<i>Celestial bodies are hollow.</i>

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.660
<i>I should be angry. It's all right
for me to be occasionally angry.</i>

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.660
<i>Hollowness is empty space.</i>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.030
<i>God resides within empty space.</i>

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:01.870
<i>Were you waiting for me
to be angry someday, Trisha?</i>

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.000
<i>Stars.</i>

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.290
<i>Cosmos.</i>

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:03.790
<i>Gods.</i>

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.120
<i>Animus.</i>

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.500
<i>Antrum.</i>

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.040
<i>Unverse.</i>

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.670
<i>Anima, Animusphere!</i>

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.680
Ms. Olga Marie's spell?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.440
Just like what I arranged.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.440
This is a surprise.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.520
Did you predict this, as well?

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:33.320
It's an elementary deduction.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.450
A good time for the second arrow!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.760
Completed loading the Mystic Eyes.

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:57.510
Commencing sequence
for Great Projection of Mystic Eyes.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.600
Anchor Car Rilcabellow has completed
connection with the Mystic Eyes!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:06.480
Analysis complete in 3... 2... 1.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:07.520
Complete.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.900
Deploying Spiritual Revolving
Lens Rose-Eye!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.530
Great Projection of Mystic Eyes!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.940
How horrible.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.150
What a wet blanket of an ending.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.110
We're going home, Faker.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:56.400
No!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:57.860
Not yet!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:01.030
I won't let you!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.000
You saw it.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.670
I'll start with you first!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.790
So, you were waiting for this opportunity

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.630
when I'd be reliant on my Mystic Eyes?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.130
Yes.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.260
Though, without Father Karabo,

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.260
I don't think the spell
would've made it in time.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.940
"Glory lies beyond the horizon.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.980
Challenge it because you know
it to be unattainable.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.610
Speak of conquest and make it real.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.530
For my men who watch behind me."

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.450
That's what he said.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.620
You're merely an underling
who fawned on him for half a month!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.950
You have no right
to speak of our fallen king!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.080
O shadow of the king,

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.460
even if you were eradicated
from history,

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:36.170
your meaning is never lost!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.840
That's why...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.880
I'm standing right here!

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:44.550
If so, try surviving from hereon, as well!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.310
Jeez.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.100
Gray...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.860
I'm leaving this to you.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:56.610
Sir?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.230
That was...

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.650
everything I had.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.660
I entrust you with my life.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:12.000
My loyalty is with my king!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.920
This one moment, allow me
to borrow the name of thunder!

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.380
<i>Gray.</i>

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:22.170
<i>Rave.</i>

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:25.430
<i>Crave.</i>

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.430
<i>Deprave.</i>

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.430
<i>Grave...</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.190
<i>...me.</i>

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:44.200
That lance is filled with prayer.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:47.410
A prayer consolidated
into thirteen shapes.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:51.450
Listen attentively
to the voices of the lance.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.910
To the ways that in ancient times,
someone prayed.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:00.670
He said "ways"! Hey, Gray!
You've had your head hung down,

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.920
knees cradled in a corner
of a room for all this time!

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:07.010
But you know, it's time for you to ask!

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.390
What you yourself want to do!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.680
Nobody will know if you don't tell them!

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.560
I want to...

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:16.810
protect Sir and everyone else!

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:19.940
I want to be someone who can protect!

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:24.990
Indeed, I heard it, Slowpoke Gray!

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:29.740
<i>Pseudo-Personality suspended.</i>

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:32.620
<i>Mana yield exceeds regulation.</i>

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>Second stage restraint rescinded.</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>Seal Thirteen... Decision, start!</i>

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:43.630
<i>This is a battle
that will harm no Elemental.</i>

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:44.630
<i>Approved.</i>

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>This is a battle against an enemy
mightier than oneself.</i>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:49.840
<i>Approved.</i>

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.680
<i>This is a battle to live.</i>

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:53.680
<i>Approved.</i>

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:56.890
<i>This is a battle
that does not stand against humanity.</i>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:57.890
<i>Approved.</i>

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:00.810
<i>This is a battle for truth.</i>

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:01.980
<i>Approved.</i>

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.860
<i>3rd stage restraint rescinded.</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:09.240
<i>Grave for you.</i>

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:11.070
<i>Old Mystics.</i>

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:13.910
<i>Exterminate sweet mysteries!</i>

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>All will return to the void!</i>

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:20.580
<i>Now, race forth... Hecatic Wheel!</i>

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.090
<i>Sacred lance,</i>

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:24.710
<i>removing restraints!</i>

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:28.470
<i>Rhongomyniad!</i>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.020
EPISODE 12: Rail Zeppelin 6/6
Lightning and Shooting Star
